Modifications in this fork
--------------------------

* Renamed the project, CLI entry points, Python modules, configuration
  directory (~/.freeide) and environment variable prefix (FREEIDE_*).
* Replaced the startup wordmark and colour palette.
* Added ten model-provider plugins covering free and no-signup inference
  tiers that upstream does not carry: Groq, Cerebras, SambaNova, Mistral,
  OVHcloud, LLM7, Nebius Token Factory, Alibaba DashScope, GitHub Models and
  local Ollama. Each carries the request quirks that were verified against
  the live APIs rather than read from documentation — for example that
  Mistral rejects any unrecognised body field with a 422, that Cerebras
  refuses max_tokens in favour of max_completion_tokens, and that OVHcloud's
  anonymous tier answers only when no Authorization header is sent at all.
* Added per-provider reasoning-effort mapping, since the field that controls
  thinking differs per provider and per model family.

